            "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request aims to fix the repository path in the installation instructions by updating the `git clone` URL. The changes made are correct, but the fix is incomplete as several other references to the old repository URL still exist throughout the documentation and Dockerfiles. I've left a comment detailing the other locations that require updating to ensure all links point to the correct repository.",
